ards  but if if you have the choice of of an  open standard that is supported by the  community and one where you have to pay  for usage  i think my preference would be to have  it open  for everyone to use out of the box  thank you um in the meantime i  don't see any further questions coming  up  so i think that might be it um  so with that in mind thank you very much  again alexander for the talk um  as well as vincent for the first talk  and with that i think we are at the end  of our discussion  um so thank you again very much for  coming  thanks to our speakers for giving  wonderful talks and  we hope to see you uh for next month's  meetup  as well and i hope you have a good  remainder of your evening  and goodbye see you next time  bye bye everyone  thank you bye  you

